WEBVTT

00:05:47.769 --> 00:05:49.548
Stay on your knees.

00:05:49.548 --> 00:05:51.588
He's being held on suspicion of murder.

00:05:51.588 --> 00:05:52.468
Murder?

00:05:59.108 --> 00:06:02.129
And though a short exchange of weapons
fire occurred just a few minutes ago,

00:06:02.129 --> 00:06:07.838
Police and S.W.A.T.Teamsmaintain position as we
enter the third hour of this intense stand-Off.

00:06:07.838 --> 00:06:12.188
Authorities estimate as many as 10
hostages are being held inside the bank.

00:06:12.188 --> 00:06:15.079
No word as yet on the
identity of the suspects

00:06:17.108 --> 00:06:18.418
Something's happening.

00:06:19.308 --> 00:06:20.328
I think they're opening a door.

00:06:20.328 --> 00:06:21.568
Roger, you getting this?

00:06:25.108 --> 00:06:26.218
Over there.

00:06:28.149 --> 00:06:30.048
Turn the camera over there.

00:06:34.188 --> 00:06:35.068
No, no, no, no, no!

00:06:35.068 --> 00:06:35.978
Don't even think about it!

00:06:35.978 --> 00:06:37.209
Get the hell back!

00:06:53.738 --> 00:06:57.078
So, what's it like -Being an fbi guy?

00:06:58.118 --> 00:06:59.108
Well...

00:06:59.108 --> 00:07:00.639
It's dangerous.

00:07:01.389 --> 00:07:01.988
You know.

00:07:02.959 --> 00:07:06.488
And the secrets we got to
keep -Oh, countless secrets.

00:07:07.168 --> 00:07:09.738
But mostly it's -It's lonely.

00:07:10.798 --> 00:07:12.248
I so know what you mean.

00:07:12.868 --> 00:07:13.538
Yeah.

00:07:15.118 --> 00:07:16.629
Helena was our head buyer.

00:07:16.629 --> 00:07:19.738
She -She was family, you know?

00:07:20.688 --> 00:07:23.488
She said it herself every
year at the christmas party.

00:07:23.488 --> 00:07:25.358
She said we were the
only family she had.

00:07:25.358 --> 00:07:27.879
So there were never any signs
that she'd do something like this.

00:07:27.879 --> 00:07:28.688
No...

00:07:28.688 --> 00:07:30.749
Still can't believe it, even now.

00:07:30.749 --> 00:07:36.368
That night, helena came back to the store after
closing, cleaned out all the display cases and the safe.

00:07:36.709 --> 00:07:41.118
Edgar, our night watchman
-He caught her in the act.

00:07:41.118 --> 00:07:42.228
He didn't know what to do.

00:07:42.228 --> 00:07:43.848
He'd known her for years.

00:07:45.408 --> 00:07:46.649
He called me at home.

00:07:47.798 --> 00:07:49.399
And that's when she took his gun?

00:07:49.728 --> 00:07:51.728
She shot him in the face.

00:07:53.858 --> 00:07:56.978
I heard him die over the phone.

00:07:57.528 --> 00:07:59.428
Any idea what her
motive could have been?

00:07:59.428 --> 00:08:00.519
What motive?

00:08:00.519 --> 00:08:01.759
It makes no sense.

00:08:01.759 --> 00:08:06.618
Why steal all those diamonds, all that
jewelry and then, what, just dump it somewhere?

00:08:07.548 --> 00:08:10.178
Just hide it and then go home.

00:08:10.178 --> 00:08:11.889
She killed herself?

00:08:11.889 --> 00:08:15.678
The cop said she dropped the hair
dryer in the bath and fried herself.

00:08:15.678 --> 00:08:17.629
They should know, right?

00:08:18.448 --> 00:08:19.218
Yeah.

00:08:20.158 --> 00:08:22.338
Well, thanks, frannie.

00:08:22.338 --> 00:08:23.578
I think that's all I need.

00:08:23.578 --> 00:08:24.468
Really?

00:08:24.468 --> 00:08:30.868
I mean, 'cause i've got more, you
know, if you wanted to interview me...

00:08:30.868 --> 00:08:33.389
Sometime in private?

00:08:35.588 --> 00:08:36.239
Yeah.

00:08:36.848 --> 00:08:38.528
Yeah, I think that's a good idea.

00:08:38.528 --> 00:08:40.028
You're a true patriot.

00:08:40.028 --> 00:08:40.649
You really are.

00:08:40.649 --> 00:08:42.379
Why don't you write your
number down there for me?

00:08:44.879 --> 00:08:47.908
So you never saw the security-Camera
footage yourself, then.

00:08:48.739 --> 00:08:51.028
The police -They took
all the tapes first thing.

00:08:51.028 --> 00:08:52.229
Of course they did.

00:08:57.959 --> 00:08:59.019
This is it.

00:09:00.338 --> 00:09:01.519
Freaking cops.

00:09:02.078 --> 00:09:02.979
They were just doing their job.

00:09:02.979 --> 00:09:05.908
No, they're doing our job, only they
don't know it, so they suck at it.

00:09:06.818 --> 00:09:08.068
Talk to me about this bank.

00:09:09.448 --> 00:09:11.848
Milwaukee national trust -It
was hit about a month ago.

00:09:11.848 --> 00:09:13.098
Same M.O.As the jewelry store?

00:09:13.098 --> 00:09:17.088
Yep, inside job, longtime employee,
the "never in a million years" type.

00:09:17.088 --> 00:09:20.989
Dude robs the bank, then goes home
and supposedly commits suicide.

00:09:20.989 --> 00:09:22.698
Resnick was the security guard on duty?

00:09:22.698 --> 00:09:26.618
Yeah, he was actually beaten unconscious
by the teller who heisted the place.

00:09:26.618 --> 00:09:27.269
Oh, god.

00:09:27.269 --> 00:09:28.199
Yeah.

00:09:29.729 --> 00:09:30.938
Mr.Resnick!

00:09:31.548 --> 00:09:32.908
Ronald resnick.

00:09:44.639 --> 00:09:46.729
Fbi, mr.Resnick.

00:09:47.749 --> 00:09:48.918
Let me see the badge.

00:09:56.019 --> 00:09:57.618
I already gave my
statement to the police.

00:09:57.618 --> 00:10:02.219
Listen, ronald, just some things about your
statement we wanted to get some clarification on.

00:10:02.219 --> 00:10:03.558
You read it?

00:10:03.558 --> 00:10:04.519
Sure did.

00:10:04.519 --> 00:10:05.798
Come to listen to what I got to say?

00:10:05.798 --> 00:10:07.038
That's why we're here.

00:10:09.848 --> 00:10:10.558
Well...

00:10:11.999 --> 00:10:12.788
Come on in.

00:10:16.489 --> 00:10:20.608
See, none of the cops ever called me back,
not after I told them what was really going on.

00:10:21.438 --> 00:10:23.038
They all thought I was crazy.

00:10:23.808 --> 00:10:27.118
First off, juan morales never
robbed the milwaukee national trust.

00:10:27.118 --> 00:10:28.628
That I guarantee.

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:29.989
See, me and juan were friends.

00:10:29.989 --> 00:10:33.649
He used to come back to the bank on
my night shifts, and we'd play cards.

00:10:35.499 --> 00:10:38.959
So you let him into the
bank that night, after hours.

00:10:38.959 --> 00:10:40.598
The thing I let into the bank...

00:10:42.019 --> 00:10:43.129
Wasn't juan.

00:10:43.868 --> 00:10:47.358
I mean, it had his face,
but it wasn't his face.

00:10:47.358 --> 00:10:51.328
Every detail was perfect, but too perfect,
you know, like if a doll maker made it,

00:10:51.328 --> 00:10:53.868
Like I was talking to a big juan doll.

00:10:53.868 --> 00:10:55.379
A juan doll?

00:10:55.379 --> 00:10:57.899
Look, this wasn't the
only time this happened.

00:10:57.899 --> 00:11:03.639
There was this jewelry store, too, and the
cops and you guys, you just won't see it.

00:11:04.399 --> 00:11:06.739
Both crimes were pulled
by the same thing.

00:11:07.198 --> 00:11:08.858
And what's that, mr.Resnick?

00:11:11.938 --> 00:11:15.098
Chinese been working on them for
years, and the russians before that

00:11:15.098 --> 00:11:22.118
Part man, part machine, like the terminator, but the kind
that can change itself, make itself look like other people.

00:11:22.118 --> 00:11:23.028
Like the one from "t2."

00:11:23.028 --> 00:11:23.818
Exactly!

00:11:23.818 --> 00:11:28.418
So not just a robot,
more of a -A man-Droid.

00:11:28.418 --> 00:11:30.028
A man-Droid?

00:11:30.479 --> 00:11:32.989
What makes you so sure
about this, ronald?

00:11:39.149 --> 00:11:41.168
I made copies of all the security tapes.

00:11:41.168 --> 00:11:43.108
I knew once the cops got
them, they'd be buried.

00:11:43.108 --> 00:11:44.098
Here.

00:11:45.688 --> 00:11:46.558
Now watch.

00:11:48.918 --> 00:11:49.889
WatcH.

00:11:51.108 --> 00:11:51.698
Watch him.

00:11:51.698 --> 00:11:52.509
Watch.Watch.

00:11:53.808 --> 00:11:55.438
See, look, there it is!

00:11:57.239 --> 00:11:57.618
You see?

00:11:57.618 --> 00:11:59.129
He's got the laser eyes.

00:12:06.759 --> 00:12:12.158
Cops said it was some kind of reflected
light, some kind of "camera flare."

00:12:12.588 --> 00:12:13.199
Okay?

00:12:13.469 --> 00:12:15.038
Ain't no damn camera flare.

00:12:15.538 --> 00:12:17.249
They say I'm a post-Trauma case.

00:12:17.249 --> 00:12:18.209
So what?

00:12:18.509 --> 00:12:19.598
Bank goes and fires me.

00:12:19.598 --> 00:12:20.528
It don't matter.

00:12:20.528 --> 00:12:23.078
The man-Droid is still out there.

00:12:25.719 --> 00:12:29.729
If the law won't hunt this
thing down, I'll do it myself.

00:12:30.348 --> 00:12:34.139
You see, this thing, I-It kills the real
person, makes it look like a suicide,

00:12:34.139 --> 00:12:39.528
Then it sort of like morphs into that person, cases
the job for a while till it knows the take is fat,

00:12:39.528 --> 00:12:41.328
And then it finds its opening.

00:12:41.739 --> 00:12:44.158
Now, these robberies,
they're grouped together,

00:12:44.158 --> 00:12:49.009
So I figure the man-Droid is holed up somewhere
in the middle -Underground maybe -I don't know.

00:12:49.009 --> 00:12:54.538
M-Maybe that's where it recharges
its m-Man-Droid batteries.

00:12:54.538 --> 00:12:55.558
Okay.

00:12:57.538 --> 00:12:59.158
I want you to listen very carefully.

00:13:00.428 --> 00:13:03.938
'Cause I'm about to tell you the
god's honest truth about all of this.

00:13:07.678 --> 00:13:09.108
There's no such thing as man-Droids.

00:13:11.558 --> 00:13:13.759
There's nothing evil or
inhuman going on out there.

00:13:13.759 --> 00:13:14.729
It's just people.

00:13:14.979 --> 00:13:15.489
Nothing else.

00:13:15.489 --> 00:13:16.399
You understand?

00:13:20.798 --> 00:13:23.139
The laser eyes just a
camera flare, mr.Resnick.

00:13:23.139 --> 00:13:27.068
I know you don't want to believe this, but
your friend juan robbed the bank, and that's it.

00:13:29.288 --> 00:13:30.548
Get out of my house!

00:13:31.709 --> 00:13:32.538
Now!

00:13:32.818 --> 00:13:33.588
Sure.

00:13:34.149 --> 00:13:34.999
First things first.

00:13:38.668 --> 00:13:41.058
Man, that has got to be
the kicker, straight up.

00:13:41.749 --> 00:13:46.918
When you told that poor son of a bitch to -What
did you say, "remand" the tapes that he copied?

00:13:47.218 --> 00:13:49.828
"Classified evidence of
an ongoing investigation"?

00:13:49.828 --> 00:13:51.058
That's messed up.

00:13:52.139 --> 00:13:53.808
What are you, pissed at me?

00:13:53.808 --> 00:13:56.828
No, I just think it's a little
creepy how good of a fed you are.

00:13:56.828 --> 00:13:58.968
We could have thrown the guy a bone.

00:13:58.968 --> 00:14:00.438
He did some good legwork here.

00:14:01.328 --> 00:14:02.428
"Man-Droid"?

00:14:02.428 --> 00:14:04.428
Except for the man-Droid part.

00:14:05.078 --> 00:14:05.859
I liked him.

00:14:05.938 --> 00:14:07.269
He's not that different from you and me.

00:14:07.269 --> 00:14:08.088
People think we're crazy.

00:14:08.088 --> 00:14:09.318
Except he's not a hunter.

00:14:09.958 --> 00:14:11.989
He's just a guy who
stumbled onto something real.

00:14:11.989 --> 00:14:14.519
If he were to go up against
this thing, he'd get torn apart.

00:14:14.519 --> 00:14:17.278
Better to stay in the
dark and stay alive.

00:14:17.278 --> 00:14:18.318
Yeah, I guess.

00:14:21.308 --> 00:14:22.218
Shapeshifter.

00:14:23.769 --> 00:14:25.428
Just like back in st.Louis.

00:14:25.479 --> 00:14:27.239
Same retinal reaction to video.

00:14:27.979 --> 00:14:29.149
Eyes flare at the camera.

00:14:30.119 --> 00:14:31.239
I hate those freaking things.

00:14:31.778 --> 00:14:32.598
You think I don't?

00:14:33.328 --> 00:14:35.769
One didn't turn into you
and frame you for murder.

00:14:38.229 --> 00:14:42.149
Well, look, if this shifter's anything like the
one we killed in missouri then ronald's right.

00:14:45.489 --> 00:14:48.509
All right, they like to lair up
underground, preferably the sewer.

00:14:48.509 --> 00:14:51.438
All the robberies have been
connected so far, right?

00:14:51.438 --> 00:14:54.188
Through the, uh, sewer main layout.

00:14:58.078 --> 00:15:00.369
There's one more bank lined
up on that same sewer main.

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:12.098
Well, we haven't had any
flags go up on our system yet.

00:15:12.098 --> 00:15:14.288
No, no, this is a glitch
in the overall grid.

00:15:14.288 --> 00:15:16.489
Just want to make sure the
branch monitors are kosher.

00:15:16.489 --> 00:15:18.308
Better to be safe than sorry, I guess.

00:15:18.308 --> 00:15:19.119
That's the plan.

00:15:23.068 --> 00:15:23.989
All righty.

00:15:24.609 --> 00:15:25.658
You guys need anything else?

00:15:25.658 --> 00:15:26.318
Oh, no, no, no.

00:15:26.318 --> 00:15:27.808
We'll be in and out.

00:15:27.808 --> 00:15:28.899
Just a routine check.

00:15:28.899 --> 00:15:30.009
Okeydokey.

00:15:33.149 --> 00:15:33.818
I like him.

00:15:33.918 --> 00:15:35.028
He says "okeydokey."

00:15:35.028 --> 00:15:36.158
What if he's the shifter?

00:15:36.158 --> 00:15:40.639
Well, then we follow him home, put a
silver bullet through his chest plate.

00:15:45.808 --> 00:15:46.838
Okay.

00:15:47.038 --> 00:15:48.359
You got any popcorn?

00:15:58.828 --> 00:16:01.308
Looks like mr.Okeydokey'S...

00:16:01.739 --> 00:16:02.788
Okeydokey.

00:16:04.509 --> 00:16:06.418
Maybe we jumped the gun on this, dean.

00:16:08.098 --> 00:16:09.578
We don't even know it's here.

00:16:10.528 --> 00:16:12.668
Maybe we should just
go to the sewers and...

00:16:13.369 --> 00:16:14.499
And...

00:16:14.499 --> 00:16:15.938
And...

00:16:19.379 --> 00:16:21.239
Dean, we're supposed
to be looking for eyes.

00:16:22.249 --> 00:16:23.468
I'm getting there.

00:16:24.259 --> 00:16:24.928
Oh, yeah?

00:16:25.139 --> 00:16:25.958
Yeah.

00:16:28.259 --> 00:16:29.389
Wait a minute.

00:16:32.568 --> 00:16:33.479
Hello, freak.

00:16:33.479 --> 00:16:34.479
Got him.

00:16:36.808 --> 00:16:37.468
Sam.

00:16:39.028 --> 00:16:39.828
What?

00:16:44.609 --> 00:16:45.989
Hello, ronald.

00:16:59.208 --> 00:17:00.818
This is not a robbery!

00:17:03.808 --> 00:17:06.479
Everybody on the floor now!

00:17:10.528 --> 00:17:11.578
Get down, damn it!

00:17:12.199 --> 00:17:12.798
Come on!

00:17:13.418 --> 00:17:14.348
On the floor, on the floor.

00:17:14.348 --> 00:17:15.798
In the middle!

00:17:16.239 --> 00:17:17.619
On the floor in the middle.

00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:19.558
In middle, on the floor, come on!

00:17:19.749 --> 00:17:20.269
Hurry up!

00:17:20.269 --> 00:17:21.168
Come on!

00:17:21.659 --> 00:17:23.679
And you said we shouldn't bring guns.

00:17:26.088 --> 00:17:27.358
I didn't know this
was gonna happen, dean.

00:17:27.358 --> 00:17:28.239
Let me do the talking.

00:17:28.239 --> 00:17:30.048
I don't think he likes
you, agent johnson.

00:17:30.628 --> 00:17:37.139
There's only one way in or out of here, and I
chained it up, so nobody's leaving, you understand?

00:17:37.479 --> 00:17:38.179
Hey, buddy.

00:17:39.429 --> 00:17:40.269
Why don't you calm down?

00:17:40.269 --> 00:17:41.429
Just calm down.

00:17:42.098 --> 00:17:42.909
What?

00:17:43.989 --> 00:17:44.999
You!

00:17:46.068 --> 00:17:47.548
Get on the floor now!

00:17:47.548 --> 00:17:48.588
Okay, we're doing that.

00:17:49.179 --> 00:17:50.828
Just don't shoot anybody, especially us.

00:17:50.828 --> 00:17:52.719
I knew it -As soon as you two left.

00:17:52.719 --> 00:17:53.769
You ain't fbi.

00:17:53.769 --> 00:17:54.848
Who are you?

00:17:55.619 --> 00:17:57.148
Who are you working for, huh?

00:17:57.148 --> 00:17:58.308
The men in black?

00:17:59.769 --> 00:18:00.918
You working for the man-Droid?

00:18:00.918 --> 00:18:02.058
We're not!

00:18:02.058 --> 00:18:03.538
You shut up!

00:18:03.538 --> 00:18:04.588
I ain't talking to you!

00:18:04.588 --> 00:18:05.979
I don't like you!

00:18:07.598 --> 00:18:08.269
Fair enough.

00:18:12.159 --> 00:18:13.338
Get over there.

00:18:13.608 --> 00:18:15.168
Frisk them down, make
sure they got no weapons.

00:18:15.168 --> 00:18:16.098
Go!

00:18:32.108 --> 00:18:33.449
And what have we here?

00:18:33.449 --> 00:18:35.139
I'm not just gonna walk in here naked.

00:18:37.479 --> 00:18:38.538
Give that there.

00:18:40.168 --> 00:18:41.219
No, no, no, no.

00:18:45.668 --> 00:18:46.999
We know you don't want to hurt anybody.

00:18:47.119 --> 00:18:49.048
But that's what's gonna happen
if you keep waving that cannon.

00:18:49.048 --> 00:18:50.369
Why don't you let these people go?

00:18:50.369 --> 00:18:51.219
No!

00:18:51.219 --> 00:18:52.358
I already told you.

00:18:52.358 --> 00:18:55.389
If nobody's gonna stop this thing,
then I've got to do it myself!

00:18:55.389 --> 00:18:56.659
We believe you!

00:18:56.659 --> 00:18:57.438
That's why we're here.

00:18:57.438 --> 00:18:58.688
You don't believe me!

00:18:59.679 --> 00:19:01.119
Nobody believes me!

00:19:02.249 --> 00:19:03.318
How could they?

00:19:06.489 --> 00:19:06.929
Come here.

00:19:08.409 --> 00:19:09.179
What?

00:19:09.499 --> 00:19:10.269
No.

00:19:10.269 --> 00:19:11.229
You're holding the gun, boss.

00:19:11.229 --> 00:19:11.979
You're calling the shots.

00:19:11.979 --> 00:19:14.358
I just want to tell
you something.Come here.

00:19:22.369 --> 00:19:23.639
It's the bank manager.

00:19:24.729 --> 00:19:25.229
What?

00:19:26.538 --> 00:19:28.519
Why do you think we
got these getups, huh?

00:19:28.969 --> 00:19:30.639
We've been monitoring
the cameras in the back.

00:19:30.639 --> 00:19:32.148
We saw the bank manager.

00:19:32.148 --> 00:19:33.558
We saw his eyes.

00:19:34.798 --> 00:19:35.679
His laser eyes?

00:19:35.679 --> 00:19:36.438
Yes.

00:19:36.438 --> 00:19:36.889
No.

00:19:36.889 --> 00:19:37.249
No!

00:19:37.249 --> 00:19:38.278
We're running out of time.

00:19:38.278 --> 00:19:40.249
We got to find him before
he changes into someone else.

00:19:40.249 --> 00:19:41.229
Like I'm gonna listen to you.

00:19:41.229 --> 00:19:42.848
You're a damn liar.

00:19:44.788 --> 00:19:45.568
I'll shoot you!

00:19:45.568 --> 00:19:46.608
Get down!

00:19:47.808 --> 00:19:48.679
Take me.

00:19:49.429 --> 00:19:51.208
Take me as a hostage.

00:19:51.208 --> 00:19:55.469
But we got to act fast because the longer we
just sit here, the more time he has to change.

00:19:56.019 --> 00:19:56.958
Look at me, man.

00:19:57.918 --> 00:19:58.749
I believe you.

00:19:59.798 --> 00:20:00.788
You're not crazy.

00:20:02.328 --> 00:20:04.389
There really is something
inside this bank.

00:20:10.938 --> 00:20:11.578
All right.

00:20:14.038 --> 00:20:15.798
Y-You come with me.

00:20:17.909 --> 00:20:19.769
But everyone else gets in the vault!

00:20:36.278 --> 00:20:37.009
Come on, move!

00:20:38.938 --> 00:20:39.858
Move, move!

00:20:40.858 --> 00:20:42.119
Then you lock it up.

00:20:50.318 --> 00:20:51.168
It's okay, everyone.

00:20:51.168 --> 00:20:52.028
Just stay cool.

00:20:56.449 --> 00:20:56.938
Now spin that.

00:20:56.938 --> 00:20:57.798
Spin that there.

00:21:00.608 --> 00:21:01.878
Who is that man?

00:21:05.048 --> 00:21:06.058
He's my brother.

00:21:07.648 --> 00:21:10.458
He is so brave.

00:21:17.068 --> 00:21:18.058
Check behind the desk.

00:21:36.619 --> 00:21:38.098
What the hell is that?

00:21:45.078 --> 00:21:46.159
Oh, great.

00:21:47.528 --> 00:21:49.558
When it changes form,
it sheds its old skin.

00:21:49.558 --> 00:21:50.999
So now it could be anybody.

00:21:53.378 --> 00:21:53.958
So...

00:21:55.828 --> 00:21:56.628
So weird.

00:21:57.699 --> 00:21:59.889
Its robot skin is so lifelike.

00:21:59.898 --> 00:22:00.929
Okay, let's get something straight.

00:22:00.929 --> 00:22:02.269
It's not a man-Droid.

00:22:02.269 --> 00:22:03.749
It's a shapeshifter.

00:22:03.749 --> 00:22:04.358
Shapeshifter?

00:22:04.358 --> 00:22:05.219
Yeah.

00:22:05.219 --> 00:22:07.159
It's human, more or less.

00:22:07.778 --> 00:22:08.588
It has human drive.

00:22:08.588 --> 00:22:09.958
And in this case, it's money.

00:22:09.958 --> 00:22:11.249
But it generates its own skin.

00:22:11.249 --> 00:22:13.868
It can shape it to match
someone else's features

00:22:14.598 --> 00:22:17.308
So I-It kills someone and
then takes their place.

00:22:17.308 --> 00:22:19.038
Kills them -I don't think it matters.

00:22:19.038 --> 00:22:20.038
What are you doing?

00:22:24.959 --> 00:22:25.618
Nice.

00:22:27.009 --> 00:22:28.638
You remember the old werewolf stories?

00:22:28.638 --> 00:22:29.929
Pretty much came from these guys.

00:22:30.479 --> 00:22:32.269
Silver's the only thing
I've seen that hurts them.

00:22:34.179 --> 00:22:35.158
Come on, ronald.

00:23:42.929 --> 00:23:43.548
How we doing?

00:23:43.969 --> 00:23:45.229
Another day in paradise.

00:23:45.679 --> 00:23:46.669
No one's come out yet?

00:23:46.669 --> 00:23:48.308
This guy locked himself in.

00:23:50.278 --> 00:23:51.368
First thing he did.

00:23:54.699 --> 00:23:55.249
All right.

00:23:56.199 --> 00:23:57.538
Cut the power.

00:23:59.179 --> 00:24:00.169
What are you, nuts?

00:24:00.169 --> 00:24:01.348
That's just it.

00:24:02.568 --> 00:24:03.719
I'm not nuts.

00:24:04.838 --> 00:24:08.658
I mean, I was so scared that I was
losing my marbles, but this is real.

00:24:09.298 --> 00:24:10.868
I mean, I-I was right.

00:24:11.548 --> 00:24:13.449
Except for the man-Droid thing.

00:24:13.449 --> 00:24:14.229
Thank you.

00:24:15.098 --> 00:24:16.088
Yeah, don't mention it.

00:24:23.689 --> 00:24:24.308
Damn it.

00:24:24.828 --> 00:24:26.618
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:24:26.618 --> 00:24:27.618
What is it?

00:24:27.618 --> 00:24:28.308
They cut the power.

00:24:28.308 --> 00:24:29.759
It's probably their way of saying hi.

00:24:29.759 --> 00:24:30.608
Who?

00:24:30.608 --> 00:24:31.608
Cops.

00:24:31.608 --> 00:24:32.709
The cops?

00:24:33.489 --> 00:24:35.479
You weren't exactly a smooth
criminal about this, ron.

00:24:35.479 --> 00:24:37.588
You didn't even secure
the security guard.

00:24:37.588 --> 00:24:38.568
He probably called them.

00:24:38.568 --> 00:24:40.398
Well, I didn't think to hang on.

00:24:40.398 --> 00:24:41.388
Let's just take a breath for a second.

00:24:43.429 --> 00:24:44.759
They probably got us surrounded.

00:24:45.788 --> 00:24:48.908
They cut the power to the cameras, so there's
no way of telling who the shapeshifter is.

00:24:50.699 --> 00:24:52.048
It's not looking good, ron.

00:24:57.449 --> 00:24:58.209
Did you hear that?

00:24:59.479 --> 00:25:01.239
Has your brother always been so...

00:25:02.058 --> 00:25:03.169
Wonderful?

00:25:03.169 --> 00:25:06.499
I mean, staring down that gun.

00:25:07.219 --> 00:25:12.078
And the way he played right into that psycho's
crazy head, telling him what he wanted to hear?

00:25:12.078 --> 00:25:17.128
Hero or something.

00:25:17.128 --> 00:25:18.138
Yeah.

00:25:18.658 --> 00:25:19.449
Yeah.

00:25:21.719 --> 00:25:23.308
Oh, my g-You saved us!

00:25:23.308 --> 00:25:24.669
You saved us!

00:25:24.669 --> 00:25:26.259
Actually I just found a few more.

00:25:27.848 --> 00:25:28.509
Come on, everybody, let's go.

00:25:28.509 --> 00:25:29.378
Let's go.

00:25:37.898 --> 00:25:39.209
What are you doing?

00:25:39.209 --> 00:25:41.618
Sam, look, ronald and
i need to talk to you.

00:25:54.288 --> 00:25:55.509
It shed its skin again.

00:25:55.509 --> 00:25:56.459
We don't know when.

00:25:56.459 --> 00:25:58.068
Could be in the halls, the vault.

00:25:59.348 --> 00:26:00.239
Great.

00:26:01.108 --> 00:26:02.989
You know, dean, you are
wanted by the police.

00:26:02.989 --> 00:26:03.898
Yeah.

00:26:03.898 --> 00:26:07.298
So even if we do find this damn thing,
how the hell are we gonna get out of here?

00:26:07.298 --> 00:26:08.888
One problem at a time.

00:26:09.709 --> 00:26:12.249
I'm gonna do a sweep of the whole
place, see if I can find any stragglers.

00:26:12.249 --> 00:26:15.019
Once we get everyone together,
we got to play "find the freak."

00:26:15.019 --> 00:26:16.148
So here.

00:26:16.148 --> 00:26:17.669
I found another one of these for you.

00:26:17.669 --> 00:26:18.689
Now, stay here.

00:26:18.689 --> 00:26:20.388
Make sure ronald doesn't hurt anybody.

00:26:20.558 --> 00:26:22.898
Help him manage the help him manage?

00:26:23.449 --> 00:26:24.628
Are you insane?

00:26:29.298 --> 00:26:30.699
Look, I know this isn't
going the way we wanted.

00:26:30.699 --> 00:26:31.528
Understatement.

00:26:31.528 --> 00:26:36.538
But if we invite the cops in right now, ronald gets
arrested, we get arrested, the shifter gets away.

00:26:36.538 --> 00:26:41.358
Probably never find
it again, okay -Ron!

00:26:42.108 --> 00:26:43.338
Out of the light!

00:26:48.108 --> 00:26:48.959
Seriously?

00:26:49.028 --> 00:26:50.378
Ron's plan was a bad plan.

00:26:50.378 --> 00:26:54.209
It was a bit of a crazy plan, but right
now, crazy's the only game in town, okay?

00:27:08.138 --> 00:27:09.249
Hi, ronald.

00:28:09.108 --> 00:28:12.138
I'm gonna keep this open, get you folks
some fresh air in there, all right?

00:28:13.229 --> 00:28:14.778
But no one leaves this vault.

00:28:18.239 --> 00:28:18.878
I don't understand.

00:28:18.878 --> 00:28:20.419
Why are you helping him?

00:28:20.679 --> 00:28:22.338
You wouldn't believe me if I told you.

00:28:24.388 --> 00:28:25.259
H-Hello?

00:28:25.259 --> 00:28:26.578
I think I got to get out of here.

00:28:26.578 --> 00:28:28.739
Sir, I'm very sorry, but you're
just gonna have to stay put.

00:28:28.739 --> 00:28:31.898
What do you mean, demands?

00:28:31.898 --> 00:28:32.929
Ronald...

00:28:32.929 --> 00:28:33.699
Hang up.

00:28:33.699 --> 00:28:35.239
I-I'm not a bank robber.

00:28:35.239 --> 00:28:36.898
I got to really get out of here.

00:28:36.898 --> 00:28:37.888
Sir, you can't leave.

00:28:37.888 --> 00:28:39.939
Kind of a crime fighter, I guess.

00:28:39.939 --> 00:28:41.068
Ronald!

00:28:44.999 --> 00:28:45.358
Look...

00:28:45.358 --> 00:28:47.009
No, I'm acting alone.

00:28:48.838 --> 00:28:49.578
Ronald...

00:28:50.588 --> 00:28:51.858
The less the cops know, the better.

00:28:51.858 --> 00:28:53.729
I think this dude's
having a heart attack!

00:28:54.408 --> 00:28:55.128
Great.

00:28:55.298 --> 00:28:56.788
Could be our guy, could be a trick.

00:28:56.788 --> 00:28:57.949
Are you just gonna let the man die?

00:28:57.949 --> 00:28:59.278
No one's dying in here!

00:28:59.679 --> 00:29:00.528
Cover the door.

00:29:08.009 --> 00:29:09.989
Can you tell me how many
hostages this guy's taken?

00:29:09.989 --> 00:29:12.189
One of the people in here
could be having heart trouble.

00:29:12.189 --> 00:29:13.558
You need to send in a paramedic.

00:29:13.558 --> 00:29:15.138
Just stay calm, sir.

00:29:15.138 --> 00:29:16.818
Just send in a paramedic, okay?!

00:29:16.818 --> 00:29:18.239
Don't try anything else!

00:29:18.239 --> 00:29:19.528
Please.

00:29:19.568 --> 00:29:20.398
Paramedic?

00:29:20.398 --> 00:29:21.669
Guy don't have time for that, man.

00:29:21.669 --> 00:29:23.999
Listen, I-I'm sorry, okay?

00:29:23.999 --> 00:29:25.098
But nobody's getting out.

00:29:25.098 --> 00:29:26.479
He's dying right in front of you.

00:29:27.709 --> 00:29:28.538
Help.

00:30:07.449 --> 00:30:07.939
Come on, man.

00:30:07.939 --> 00:30:09.278
You got to unlock the front door.

00:30:10.009 --> 00:30:11.098
We got to get him out of here.

00:30:11.808 --> 00:30:13.709
Both of you stay where you are!

00:30:20.858 --> 00:30:21.788
You know what, ronald?

00:30:22.588 --> 00:30:23.278
He's right.

00:30:23.568 --> 00:30:24.949
We got to get this man outside.

00:30:24.949 --> 00:30:25.469
Come on.

00:30:25.469 --> 00:30:26.298
I got you.

00:30:26.949 --> 00:30:27.908
I'll help you.

00:30:27.908 --> 00:30:28.548
Oh, I got him.

00:30:28.548 --> 00:30:29.669
It's cool.

00:30:29.669 --> 00:30:30.628
Thanks.

00:30:32.199 --> 00:30:32.798
Watch your step.

00:30:32.798 --> 00:30:33.259
Thank you.

00:30:33.259 --> 00:30:33.778
Sure.

00:30:33.778 --> 00:30:34.548
Thank you.

00:30:40.158 --> 00:30:41.548
Let's go up these steps.

00:30:46.759 --> 00:30:47.959
Hey, can I talk to you for a second?

00:30:50.628 --> 00:30:51.689
You have the gun, man.

00:30:53.148 --> 00:30:53.838
Whatever.

00:30:59.959 --> 00:31:00.469
Stop!

00:31:00.469 --> 00:31:01.919
Come back here!

00:31:55.219 --> 00:31:55.838
Here.

00:31:58.699 --> 00:31:59.669
Take care of the guard.

00:32:00.308 --> 00:32:01.459
I'm going after the shifter.

00:32:17.578 --> 00:32:18.509
Sorry, ron.

00:32:19.388 --> 00:32:20.878
You did a real good
job tracking this thing.

00:32:20.878 --> 00:32:21.769
You really did.

00:32:53.919 --> 00:32:55.658
Oh, god, please don't hurt us.

00:32:55.658 --> 00:32:57.269
You shouldn't be back here right now!

00:32:57.269 --> 00:32:58.019
You're in danger!

00:32:58.019 --> 00:32:59.949
Now go back to the vault, now.

00:33:13.528 --> 00:33:15.558
Don't shoot! Don't shoot! Please!

00:33:15.979 --> 00:33:16.699
No, no, no, no!

00:33:16.699 --> 00:33:17.699
Back up!

00:33:18.019 --> 00:33:19.128
Don't even think about it!

00:33:19.528 --> 00:33:21.618
Please, don't shoot!

00:33:26.699 --> 00:33:28.148
I said get back now!

00:33:29.568 --> 00:33:30.949
One of the hostages seems to
have taken over the situation.

00:33:30.949 --> 00:33:32.338
Excuse me?

00:33:33.148 --> 00:33:34.778
Go, go, go.

00:33:43.568 --> 00:33:44.638
We are so screwed.

00:33:52.398 --> 00:33:53.179
Yeah?

00:33:53.179 --> 00:33:54.368
Slipped his skin.

00:33:54.368 --> 00:33:55.098
What?

00:33:55.098 --> 00:33:58.499
Yeah, bastard shifts fast, a lot
faster than the one in st.Louis.

00:33:58.499 --> 00:34:00.189
It's like playing a shell game.

00:34:00.189 --> 00:34:01.449
It could be anybody again.

00:34:01.719 --> 00:34:03.499
I think most of the
employees are in the vault.

00:34:03.499 --> 00:34:04.939
You search every inch of this place.

00:34:04.939 --> 00:34:06.388
I'm gonna go round everybody up.

00:34:21.969 --> 00:34:22.708
Crap.

00:34:22.708 --> 00:34:23.599
What?

00:34:23.599 --> 00:34:24.989
The feds are here.

00:34:26.028 --> 00:34:27.408
Oh, crap.

00:34:33.208 --> 00:34:34.208
Lieutenant robards.

00:34:34.979 --> 00:34:35.608
Yeah.

00:34:35.998 --> 00:34:37.449
Special agent hendrickson.

00:34:37.449 --> 00:34:38.568
Let me guess.

00:34:38.568 --> 00:34:41.929
You're lead dog now, but you would
just love my full cooperation.

00:34:41.929 --> 00:34:43.358
I don't give a rat's ass what you do.

00:34:43.358 --> 00:34:45.608
You can go get a doughnut and
bang your wife for all I care.

00:34:45.608 --> 00:34:48.288
What I do need is your
S.W.A.T.Team locked and loaded.

00:34:49.708 --> 00:34:53.148
Listen, agent, something's
not right about this.

00:34:53.949 --> 00:34:54.689
It's, uh...

00:34:55.949 --> 00:34:57.878
It's not going down like a usual heist.

00:34:57.878 --> 00:34:59.368
That's because it isn't one.

00:34:59.849 --> 00:35:02.108
You have no idea what
you're dealing with, do you?

00:35:02.769 --> 00:35:05.219
There is a monster
in that bank, robards.

00:35:30.759 --> 00:35:32.849
And I thought you were
one of the good guys.

00:35:34.748 --> 00:35:35.479
What's your name?

00:35:35.788 --> 00:35:36.828
Why would you care?

00:35:37.199 --> 00:35:37.989
My name's dean.

00:35:40.219 --> 00:35:40.818
I'm sheri.

00:35:42.009 --> 00:35:42.809
Hi, sheri.

00:35:46.989 --> 00:35:48.229
Everything's gonna be all right.

00:35:48.439 --> 00:35:50.038
This will all be over soon, okay?

00:36:02.708 --> 00:36:03.318
Yeah.

00:36:03.469 --> 00:36:05.219
This is special agent
victor hendrickson.

00:36:05.219 --> 00:36:07.599
I'm not really in a negotiating mood.

00:36:07.599 --> 00:36:08.729
Good.Me neither.

00:36:08.729 --> 00:36:11.528
It's my job to bring you in
-Alive's a bonus, but not necessary.

00:36:11.528 --> 00:36:13.838
That's harsh for a federal
agent, don't you think?

00:36:13.838 --> 00:36:15.858
Well, you're not the typical
suspect, are you, dean?

00:36:18.078 --> 00:36:21.389
I want you and sam out
here unarmed, or we come in.

00:36:21.389 --> 00:36:23.918
And, yes, I know about
sam -Bonnie to your clyde.

00:36:24.559 --> 00:36:27.189
Yeah, well, that part's true, but
how'd you even know we were here?

00:36:27.189 --> 00:36:28.048
Go screw yourself.

00:36:28.048 --> 00:36:29.099
That's how I knew.

00:36:29.099 --> 00:36:31.318
It's become my job to
know about you, dean.

00:36:31.318 --> 00:36:33.269
I've been looking for you for weeks now.

00:36:33.269 --> 00:36:36.739
I know about the murder in st.Louis,
the houdini act you pulled in baltimore.

00:36:36.739 --> 00:36:39.148
I know about the
desecrations and the thefts.

00:36:39.148 --> 00:36:40.439
I know about your dad.

00:36:40.439 --> 00:36:42.559
You don't know crap about my dad.

00:36:42.559 --> 00:36:48.828
Ex-Marine, raised his kids on the road, cheap motels,
backwood cabins -Real paramilitary survivalist type.

00:36:48.828 --> 00:36:54.219
I just can't get a handle on what type of wacko he
was -White supremist, timmy mcveigh, tomato, tomahto.

00:36:54.219 --> 00:36:56.648
You got no right talking
about my dad like that.

00:36:57.199 --> 00:36:58.338
He was a hero.

00:36:58.449 --> 00:36:59.568
Yeah, right.

00:36:59.568 --> 00:37:00.708
Sure sounds like it.

00:37:00.708 --> 00:37:04.519
You have one hour to make a decision, or
we come through those doors full automatic.

00:37:11.078 --> 00:37:11.769
Scramble your men.

00:37:11.769 --> 00:37:13.108
Five minutes, then we go in.

00:37:13.108 --> 00:37:13.989
What?

00:37:13.989 --> 00:37:16.628
Hendrickson, they've let
out one hostage so far.

00:37:16.628 --> 00:37:17.969
They've hurt no one
as far as we can tell.

00:37:17.969 --> 00:37:19.489
You don't know these winchesters.

00:37:19.489 --> 00:37:21.158
They're dangerous and expertly trained.

00:37:21.158 --> 00:37:23.128
We can't risk the lives
of all those people.

00:37:23.128 --> 00:37:25.068
Dean's a greater risk
to them than we are.

00:37:25.068 --> 00:37:25.898
This is crazy.

00:37:25.898 --> 00:37:28.679
Crazy's in there, and
I just hung up on it.

00:38:06.408 --> 00:38:07.548
Amn it.

00:38:11.298 --> 00:38:12.838
We got a bit of a problem outside.

00:38:14.349 --> 00:38:15.479
We got a problem in here.

00:38:19.128 --> 00:38:19.979
Sheri?

00:38:20.809 --> 00:38:21.679
We're gonna let you go.

00:38:22.199 --> 00:38:22.979
What?

00:38:24.038 --> 00:38:24.878
Why me?

00:38:25.139 --> 00:38:26.898
As a show of good faith
to the feds.Come on.

00:38:31.199 --> 00:38:33.969
I think I'd rather stay
here with the others.

00:38:34.949 --> 00:38:36.199
I'm afraid I'm gonna have to insist.

00:38:59.048 --> 00:39:00.139
I thought you were letting me go.

00:39:02.158 --> 00:39:03.979
Oh, god!

00:39:06.548 --> 00:39:08.958
Was that community theater, or
are you just naturally that good?

00:39:08.958 --> 00:39:11.418
This is the last time
you become anybody, ever.

00:39:11.939 --> 00:39:12.778
God

00:39:36.368 --> 00:39:37.519
Dean, wait, wait, wait.

00:39:39.488 --> 00:39:40.759
What's the advantage of this plan?

00:39:42.649 --> 00:39:44.618
I mean, fainting now
wouldn't help it survive.

00:39:51.679 --> 00:39:52.528
No!

00:40:25.069 --> 00:40:26.359
Get her out of here now!

00:41:25.319 --> 00:41:26.118
Don't shoot!

00:41:27.229 --> 00:41:28.238
Don't shoot!

00:41:29.038 --> 00:41:29.578
I work here.

00:41:29.979 --> 00:41:30.689
I work here.

00:42:34.109 --> 00:42:35.229
Gross.

00:43:31.939 --> 00:43:32.469
Move!

00:43:32.469 --> 00:43:32.998
Clear!

00:43:32.998 --> 00:43:33.868
Move!

00:43:35.048 --> 00:43:35.868
Clear.

00:43:36.248 --> 00:43:37.229
Move.

00:43:37.618 --> 00:43:38.319
Clear.

00:43:43.019 --> 00:43:45.599
Male, african-American, goner.

00:43:47.328 --> 00:43:50.769
Telling you, man, I just
walked her out of the bank.

00:43:51.918 --> 00:43:54.189
She must have a twin
sister or something.

00:44:09.588 --> 00:44:11.359
Sir, my team said it's secure.

00:44:11.359 --> 00:44:11.979
They're gone.

00:44:11.979 --> 00:44:15.578
You tell your team to tear it apart
-The ducts, the ceilings, everything.

00:44:15.578 --> 00:44:16.759
I don't think that's necessary.

00:44:16.759 --> 00:44:17.899
Why not?

00:45:25.259 --> 00:45:26.639
We are so screwed.



